# Test: storage-1 AC18 history consumer survives a selected-folder daemon restart.
# VALIDATES: Serves a manifest whose minimum-version blocks the upgrade, waits for the one blocked-minimum-version event, stops the manifest server, and checks the same event after restart.
# PREVENTS: a working generic state RPC hiding a consumer that never restores.
# The fixture launches ze start <selected>/router.conf without a config-dir pin.
# The daemon is the runner's own build: ze_distro with a numeric version stamp,
# which the self-updater requires before it reports a running version.
option=timeout:value=70s
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture storage/consumer-restart history:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=OK: history consumer restored operational state from selected tree without config-dir pin
